    "detailed_description": "Being a detective is no easy task! But the brave Detective Louis has no fear as he embarks on a journey into the heart of the Amazon jungle to help his client solve a mysterious case!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n150 colorful nonogram puzzles with your choice of difficulty, a detective story full of twists and turns, and a pleasant soundtrack have all been crafted for your enjoyment! Challenge yourself and pass some time unraveling mysterious puzzles!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete levels, solve puzzles, and follow Detective Louis as he solves the challenging case of the Amazon Mystery!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 150 vibrant and memorable levels!<br />\r\n- Eye-popping graphical effects!<br />\r\n- A captivating story!<br />\r\n- Colorful scenes straight from the Amazon jungle!<br />\r\n- Flex your mental muscles: train your skills of logic and abstract reasoning!<br />\r\n- Intuitive UI and engaging gameplay!",
